WEBVTT

00:00:25.330 --> 00:00:26.750
<b>Sendagaya Station     Shinanomachi Station     Yotsuya Station</b>

00:00:26.750 --> 00:00:28.630
<b>Commuter Express</b>

00:00:29.090 --> 00:00:31.130
Synchronization with current 
location complete.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.530
<b>Being and Time</b>

00:00:33.730 --> 00:00:37.140
Confirm test movie taken at the 
director's office two hours ago.

00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:41.560
<b>Police Database</b>

00:00:39.810 --> 00:00:41.560
<b>Enter Password</b>

00:00:46.290 --> 00:00:47.100
Done.

00:00:47.710 --> 00:00:51.610
If you wish to contribute, it is a possibility.

00:00:51.610 --> 00:00:52.500
Then...

00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:53.490
Yes.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:57.910
Kazari Asami, we will make an exception and 
allow you to end your internship early.

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.490
As of today, you are assigned

00:01:00.490 --> 00:01:03.990
to Special Public Security Division 5, 
Third Mobile Assault Unit 8.

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:05.630
Are you serious?

00:01:05.630 --> 00:01:06.920
Do you object?

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.550
No, this makes it even more worthwhile.

00:01:09.550 --> 00:01:12.710
These are parts for the newest Willwear.

00:01:13.010 --> 00:01:16.130
Can you master it and view the 
video footage taken here?

00:01:18.140 --> 00:01:20.250
This is way too easy.

00:01:19.430 --> 00:01:20.600
<b>Unit 8 (Unofficial)</b>

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:23.220
Unit 8... An experimental division 
that comes with significant baggage,

00:01:20.600 --> 00:01:21.930
<b>Name: Yamabuki Rin     Rank: Senior Superintendent 
Note: Special Public Security Division 5, 
Third Mobile Assault Unit 8 Chief</b>

00:01:22.220 --> 00:01:23.970
<b>Name: Funasaka Yasuharu     Rank: Inspector 
Note: Special Public Security Division 5, 
Third Mobile Assault Unit 8 Section Chief</b>

00:01:23.220 --> 00:01:24.890
created in the police department

00:01:23.970 --> 00:01:24.890
<b>Name: Kuroki Takeru     Rank: Assistant Inspector</b>

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:25.680
<b>Name: Sena Souichirou     Rank: Assistant Inspector</b>

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.390
at the insistence of the defense ministry.

00:01:25.680 --> 00:01:26.190
<b>Name: Hoshimiya Haruka     Rank: Sergeant</b>

00:01:26.190 --> 00:01:27.210
<b>Name: Amano Madoka     Rank: Officer</b>

00:01:27.390 --> 00:01:30.110
<b>Woof Woof News</b>

00:01:28.040 --> 00:01:29.860
It is a group of incompetents

00:01:29.860 --> 00:01:34.360
frequently criticized for collateral damage 
or other actions violating protocol.

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.320
<b>garbage men</b>

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.780
Is it really a unit of garbage men,

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.530
or are they just trash themselves?

00:01:40.980 --> 00:01:41.660
Hey.

00:01:43.780 --> 00:01:46.560
You really should use public mode for that.

00:01:49.610 --> 00:01:51.050
What's with her?

00:01:57.950 --> 00:01:59.220
Either way,

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:02.970
I'll take over Japan's ACTIVE Project.

00:02:10.500 --> 00:02:12.630
<i>In response to an increase in heinous crimes,</i>

00:02:12.630 --> 00:02:17.070
<i>a new movement is picking up steam in police 
and security forces around the world.</i>

00:02:18.680 --> 00:02:23.130
<i>This is the story of the services 
performed by ACTIVE in Japan.</i>

00:03:33.770 --> 00:03:36.770
<b>File 1: Code No. 538</b>

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:39.960
Thou shalt not be proud.

00:03:40.380 --> 00:03:43.480
You are neither strong nor absolute.

00:03:43.880 --> 00:03:49.040
Soon, our friends will teach you the truth.

00:03:49.870 --> 00:03:51.880
Fate, coincidence...

00:03:51.880 --> 00:03:55.000
All are merely offerings to the same plate.

00:03:55.510 --> 00:04:00.380
Yes, when he and I ring the bell...

00:04:01.510 --> 00:04:02.360
Who are the perps?

00:04:02.360 --> 00:04:03.750
They're thought to be a pair.

00:04:03.750 --> 00:04:05.320
Use of Willwear confirmed.

00:04:05.320 --> 00:04:07.320
We've received authorization to shoot!

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:08.640
Good! Fire!

00:04:15.490 --> 00:04:16.190
It can't be...

00:04:26.860 --> 00:04:28.030
<i>I know...</i>

00:04:28.330 --> 00:04:30.660
<i>My role requires me to be a spy of sorts.</i>

00:04:33.120 --> 00:04:34.990
<i>I will determine what's happening at Unit 8</i>

00:04:34.990 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>and report whether it merits
continued existence.</i>

00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.510
<i>But that's only the official motive.</i>

00:04:40.830 --> 00:04:44.150
<i>I know what the brass really wants.</i>

00:04:43.510 --> 00:04:44.760
<b>Restricted Area</b>

00:04:45.080 --> 00:04:49.300
<i>They want me to personally shape 
Unit 8 into a force of good.</i>

00:04:49.770 --> 00:04:52.280
<i>To do so, I must first initiate conversations—</i>

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:53.230
Good morning.

00:04:53.230 --> 00:04:55.770
Oh, g-good morning!

00:04:56.360 --> 00:04:56.940
Huh?

00:05:00.290 --> 00:05:01.670
Wait... What?

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.690
We've received sortie orders.

00:05:03.690 --> 00:05:05.460
Let's head to the command vehicle.

00:05:05.460 --> 00:05:07.770
Oh, I should introduce myself.

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.000
I've been assigned here as of today.

00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:12.950
Kazari-san, right? I've been informed.

00:05:12.950 --> 00:05:15.220
I'm the section chief, Funasaka.

00:05:15.220 --> 00:05:16.210
And I am...

00:05:16.450 --> 00:05:17.140
Huh?

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:18.970
Sena Souichirou.

00:05:19.270 --> 00:05:21.800
I guess my motto is "Separate the trash properly."

00:05:21.800 --> 00:05:23.920
<b>Glass            Plastic            Cans</b>

00:05:23.920 --> 00:05:26.200
Oh? Was there more left?

00:05:26.200 --> 00:05:27.930
Under the table. His.

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.930
Welcome to the mobile assault center.

00:05:31.180 --> 00:05:34.050
I'm Sergeant Hoshimiya Haruka.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.200
I'm currently into buses.

00:05:36.200 --> 00:05:39.560
My goal for the foreseeable future is to 
conquer all Tokyo bus LED displays.

00:05:39.910 --> 00:05:40.570
That's all.

00:05:40.570 --> 00:05:41.360
Huh?

00:05:41.360 --> 00:05:44.250
Um, more importantly, wasn't there an incident?

00:05:46.570 --> 00:05:49.100
Can you first give me an overview?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.830
<b>Amano Madoka. 
It's pronounced "Madoka." 
Nice to meet you.</b>

00:05:59.100 --> 00:06:01.840
Oh, are you the new girl?

00:06:01.840 --> 00:06:04.240
I'm Yamabuki Rin, the chief.

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:05.010
Nice to meet you.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:05.610
Huh?

00:06:05.610 --> 00:06:07.880
I bet you're thinking, "Wow, she's short!"

00:06:07.880 --> 00:06:08.800
Uh...

00:06:09.480 --> 00:06:12.070
Oh... Where's my notepad?

00:06:12.070 --> 00:06:12.840
Huh?

00:06:12.840 --> 00:06:13.790
Huh? Huh?

00:06:20.960 --> 00:06:24.650
They've arranged for a Chuo Express train 
to Tokyo passing through here at 9:12

00:06:24.650 --> 00:06:28.010
to make an emergency stop and link up with us.

00:06:28.010 --> 00:06:30.490
Let's have our briefing while we wait.

00:06:31.430 --> 00:06:33.410
Kazari-san, you'll observe 
until ordered otherwise.

00:06:33.410 --> 00:06:35.240
Wait, I can always—

00:06:37.160 --> 00:06:40.370
Based on your ankle size, 
you must be the newbie.

00:06:40.370 --> 00:06:41.960
And who are you?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:44.200
People call me Kyoukai-san.

00:06:44.200 --> 00:06:45.130
Huh?

00:06:45.380 --> 00:06:48.510
There's an association of companies 
producing Willwears.

00:06:48.830 --> 00:06:51.640
He's a maintenance man sent by them.

00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.030
I guess you could call it my code name.

00:06:54.330 --> 00:06:56.630
That's a Willwear part 
specifically for you, right?

00:06:56.630 --> 00:06:57.490
Yes...

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:58.910
Give it to me later.

00:06:58.910 --> 00:07:01.650
I'll add it to your Willwear by night's end.

00:07:01.650 --> 00:07:02.330
All right.

00:07:02.650 --> 00:07:06.150
Okay, so who're we missing?

00:07:06.510 --> 00:07:09.410
Just a man who doesn't pick up his trash.

00:07:09.410 --> 00:07:13.410
I got a message saying he'll be late because 
he's helping out at a branch.

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.720
Then, Assistant Inspector Kuroki Takeru

00:07:15.720 --> 00:07:17.910
will join us at the rendezvous point.

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:24.330
Since we have a new member, 
let's cover the basics.

00:07:24.330 --> 00:07:27.430
Willwears were developed as 
an auxiliary power device.

00:07:27.430 --> 00:07:28.920
Given their output, when they're used for crime—

00:07:28.920 --> 00:07:30.210
I know.

00:07:30.210 --> 00:07:32.580
The actuators, which use synthetic muscle,

00:07:32.580 --> 00:07:35.540
can make Willwears difficult to counter 
with standard equipment.

00:07:35.540 --> 00:07:37.940
The government is currently moving 
toward amending the Police Act—

00:07:37.940 --> 00:07:40.530
Thanks. On to the real subject at hand, then.

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:45.750
Today, at 7:46 AM, two Willwear units infiltrated

00:07:45.750 --> 00:07:49.510
the Iwasaki Material Laboratory, 
in Oomiya District, Saitama City.

00:07:49.510 --> 00:07:50.360
Two?

00:07:50.360 --> 00:07:51.140
Correct.

00:07:51.140 --> 00:07:54.620
They share the same base, but one unit 
appears to have specialized equipment.

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.590
After seizing 250kg of gold,
the two units entered

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:01.100
the tracks of the Second 
City Express Saitama Line,

00:08:01.100 --> 00:08:04.580
and they're currently heading toward 
Tokyo Station at an average of 50kph.

00:08:06.340 --> 00:08:08.890
<i>Chuo Express departing for Tokyo Station.</i>

00:08:11.530 --> 00:08:14.390
<b>Chuo Line Kichijoji Station</b>

00:08:16.770 --> 00:08:20.860
Ugh, how much longer do we have 
to follow this launch method?

00:08:20.860 --> 00:08:24.560
Until other agencies transfer over to us, I guess.

00:08:24.560 --> 00:08:27.240
After all, this is partly to 
conduct various tests.

00:08:27.240 --> 00:08:29.270
Then I guess it'll be this way 
for the next ten years.

00:08:31.940 --> 00:08:33.530
Excuse me, boss.

00:08:33.530 --> 00:08:38.180
I've determined the perps' Willwear specs 
from the lab's security camera footage.

00:08:38.180 --> 00:08:40.060
They can liquefy materials 
with ultrasonic vibrations.

00:08:40.060 --> 00:08:43.200
A heavy-machinery attachment 
from Yuusei Heavy Industries, then.

00:08:43.200 --> 00:08:46.890
But isn't the base unit the 
Autumn Group's IW series?

00:08:46.890 --> 00:08:48.910
Another modded Willwear?

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:50.300
There've been lots of those lately.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:52.390
There's a high possibility that

00:08:52.390 --> 00:08:54.650
they're backed by organized crime.

00:08:54.650 --> 00:08:55.540
In my opinion—

00:08:55.540 --> 00:08:58.810
Oh, let's save the speculation for later.

00:08:58.810 --> 00:09:01.060
Now, let's not get too ahead of ourselves...

00:09:00.250 --> 00:09:01.880
Incoming message from Saitama HQ.

00:09:02.530 --> 00:09:04.440
They're going to seal off the Warabi Tollgate.

00:09:04.730 --> 00:09:07.390
So we'll try to stop them right before Arakawa?

00:09:07.390 --> 00:09:08.450
I can see why.

00:09:08.450 --> 00:09:09.330
We can't.

00:09:09.330 --> 00:09:10.440
Why not?

00:09:10.690 --> 00:09:13.650
The perps are intentionally drawing 
attention to themselves.

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.610
<b>Expressway Route 5 Ikebukuro Line</b>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.610
<b>Tokyo Outer Loop Expressway</b>

00:09:13.650 --> 00:09:16.610
<b>Second City Express Saitama Line</b>

00:09:14.140 --> 00:09:16.610
Most likely, they won't stay on this road.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:29.020
Ah, they switched to the Outer Loop Express.

00:09:29.020 --> 00:09:31.350
Does that mean they'll move to Route 5?

00:09:31.670 --> 00:09:34.500
Contact police HQ! Request a sniper team!

00:09:34.500 --> 00:09:35.420
Request denied.

00:09:35.420 --> 00:09:36.090
Huh?

00:09:36.670 --> 00:09:38.510
We've just identified the perps

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:41.120
as two males, aged sixteen.

00:09:41.120 --> 00:09:42.190
Is that good intel?

00:09:42.190 --> 00:09:44.430
Yes. I'll put it on the main monitor.

00:09:44.730 --> 00:09:47.940
<b>Those tax thieves got
what they deserved!

00:09:45.460 --> 00:09:48.470
They've outed themselves on the net.

00:09:47.940 --> 00:09:53.190
<b>Stupid, too

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:49.560
What idiots.

00:09:49.560 --> 00:09:50.490
Indeed.

00:09:50.490 --> 00:09:53.190
You can't have a mistress 
if you aren't married.

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:54.690
That's not what I meant!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:55.570
Oh.

00:09:55.870 --> 00:09:59.570
I meant they'll get caught right away 
by doing things like that.

00:09:59.570 --> 00:10:00.470
Precisely.

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:01.350
Huh?

00:10:01.350 --> 00:10:03.200
They might not be thinking much at all.

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:06.900
If they reach Ikebukuro, there are 
too many routes they could take.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:14.610
The mobile assault vehicle will be 
standing by at Shinjuku Station.

00:10:14.610 --> 00:10:16.920
Sena-kun, prepare Oscar I.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.950
Roger.

00:10:17.950 --> 00:10:20.680
Wait a minute. We have yet 
to receive official approval.

00:10:20.960 --> 00:10:24.950
As long as we stay inside, equipping 
Willwear shouldn't be a problem, right?

00:10:26.770 --> 00:10:28.440
We've arrived at the standby platform.

00:10:28.440 --> 00:10:30.730
Itabashi authorities have 
raised no objections.

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:33.230
Oscar I, equip inner unit.

00:10:36.120 --> 00:10:38.200
Vitals, all green.

00:10:38.200 --> 00:10:39.300
All green.

00:10:39.300 --> 00:10:40.950
All green, lock.

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:51.210
Inner unit, begin output.

00:10:54.710 --> 00:10:57.550
Oscar I, set Elf Sigma Unit.

00:11:11.640 --> 00:11:15.950
Given what we know of the perps' equipment, 
I'd prefer to also deploy Oscar II, but...

00:11:15.950 --> 00:11:18.490
I wonder where he's gone off to.

00:11:19.240 --> 00:11:20.990
Speak of the devil...

00:11:21.400 --> 00:11:25.260
Kuroki-san, we're at this platform today!

00:11:25.260 --> 00:11:26.920
Okay, got it!

00:11:32.590 --> 00:11:33.720
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:11:33.720 --> 00:11:35.670
Kuroki Takeru, reporting for duty.

00:11:35.670 --> 00:11:37.840
I'm glad you made it in time.

00:11:37.840 --> 00:11:41.770
Yeah, having you guys come to 
Shinjuku was a huge help.

00:11:42.390 --> 00:11:43.130
So...

00:11:43.650 --> 00:11:45.850
Where are these brainless perps?

00:11:51.010 --> 00:11:54.360
Um, so that's the guy who 
didn't take out his trash.

00:11:54.360 --> 00:11:55.390
Kuroki-san.

00:11:55.390 --> 00:11:56.730
And the girl?

00:11:56.730 --> 00:11:58.810
No idea... I wonder who she is.

00:11:58.810 --> 00:11:59.690
Kazari Asami!

00:11:59.690 --> 00:12:00.940
Y-Yes?

00:12:00.940 --> 00:12:02.460
I thought that was you.

00:12:02.760 --> 00:12:04.950
Here's your notepad. You should 
notice being pickpocketed.

00:12:04.950 --> 00:12:06.170
What?!

00:12:06.170 --> 00:12:07.200
H-Hey!

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:08.140
Catch!

00:12:10.160 --> 00:12:12.440
Th-Thank you.

00:12:12.740 --> 00:12:16.840
But why are you bringing a suspect 
to the scene of a different crime?

00:12:17.090 --> 00:12:19.630
I wouldn't have made it back in time otherwise.

00:12:19.940 --> 00:12:23.800
The suspect fell ill while being 
escorted, so I had her rest.

00:12:24.290 --> 00:12:28.010
It just means I duly observed the Code of 
Criminal Investigations, Article 104, right?

00:12:28.010 --> 00:12:30.240
Those are just words!

00:12:30.240 --> 00:12:34.020
Sorry to interrupt, but the 
operation has been cancelled.

00:12:34.020 --> 00:12:34.980
Huh?

00:12:34.980 --> 00:12:37.780
But the termination request 
originated in Suginami Ward.

00:12:37.780 --> 00:12:39.480
Isn't the operation site in Itabashi Ward?

00:12:39.480 --> 00:12:44.260
Well, there's an animation company in 
Suginami with a project on a tight deadline,

00:12:44.260 --> 00:12:48.800
and they outsource their 3D rendering 
to a company in Itabashi.

00:12:48.800 --> 00:12:50.570
If that area has a blackout,

00:12:50.570 --> 00:12:54.380
they'll have to cancel the episode, so a 
city council member gave his support.

00:12:54.380 --> 00:12:56.580
What's anime got to do with politics?

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.580
The anime company's agency apparently handles 
said council member's campaign strategy

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:03.840
for his soon-to-be-public gubernatorial bid.

00:13:03.840 --> 00:13:05.340
Damn it all!

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:09.010
Everything and everyone is just 
a pawn in their power play!

00:13:09.010 --> 00:13:11.740
It was an impossible operation to start with.

00:13:11.740 --> 00:13:14.220
Let's focus on minimizing collateral damage

00:13:14.220 --> 00:13:15.960
and holding ourselves to the tenets of justice—

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:15.960
Whoa!

00:13:16.770 --> 00:13:18.980
<b>12093 followers in 2 hours! Thanks! 

00:13:17.360 --> 00:13:20.020
The perps have over ten 
thousand followers now.

00:13:20.020 --> 00:13:20.950
Huh?

00:13:21.280 --> 00:13:24.440
Um, what about me?

00:13:24.440 --> 00:13:26.160
Maybe we can put her in the back?

00:13:26.560 --> 00:13:28.660
I have to get ready to sortie, too.

00:13:28.660 --> 00:13:31.010
Oh, you can't do that right away.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:31.660
Why not?

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:35.910
I thought you wouldn't get here in time, 
so I charged mine up first.

00:13:35.910 --> 00:13:37.200
What should we do?

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:40.350
The perps are headed toward Ikebukuro.

00:13:40.350 --> 00:13:43.000
For now, put the other case's 
suspect in the transport.

00:13:43.000 --> 00:13:43.670
Sena-kun?

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.390
Here.

00:13:44.390 --> 00:13:47.290
Delay the perps on the expressway.

00:13:47.290 --> 00:13:50.680
Oscar II will rendezvous with 
you later, so play it safe.

00:13:51.050 --> 00:13:52.260
Any civilian vehicles?

00:13:52.260 --> 00:13:53.960
They've already been diverted.

00:13:53.960 --> 00:13:55.550
Then I have no objections.

00:13:55.890 --> 00:13:59.150
I can handle sorting the 
trash just fine on my own.

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:02.950
Oscar I, permission to sortie granted.

00:14:00.750 --> 00:14:04.050
<b>Verifying</b>

00:14:02.950 --> 00:14:03.890
Permission confirmed.

00:14:04.050 --> 00:14:05.420
<b>Approved</b>

00:14:05.630 --> 00:14:09.280
Oscar I, data-link to mobile 
assault vehicle confirmed.

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.660
Request permission to launch.

00:14:10.920 --> 00:14:11.910
Permission granted.

00:14:12.160 --> 00:14:12.910
Permission granted.

00:14:12.910 --> 00:14:13.660
Launching!

00:14:29.450 --> 00:14:31.220
Huh? What is that?

00:14:31.780 --> 00:14:34.700
Cyril Kashiwagi and Mariano 
Edralin Tanaka, correct?

00:14:35.020 --> 00:14:36.190
This is the police.

00:14:36.190 --> 00:14:38.380
You will be arrested for armed robbery,

00:14:38.380 --> 00:14:40.790
property damage, obstruction 
of justice, and other charges.

00:14:41.150 --> 00:14:43.440
Power off your Willwears 
immediately and surrender.

00:14:45.940 --> 00:14:48.700
Oh, boy... So that's how it's gonna be, huh?

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.450
They're still posting to the net.

00:14:51.450 --> 00:14:55.120
<b>What's going on? 

00:14:51.780 --> 00:14:55.290
Maybe they think we'll hold back 
because they're minors.

00:14:56.670 --> 00:14:58.960
Or could it be...

00:14:58.960 --> 00:14:59.970
Three...

00:14:59.970 --> 00:15:00.900
Two...

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:01.850
One.

00:15:02.690 --> 00:15:04.610
Warning was ignored. Now at Level 2.

00:15:04.610 --> 00:15:06.960
Oscar I, deploy a drone, just in case.

00:15:06.960 --> 00:15:08.090
Roger.

00:15:09.270 --> 00:15:12.250
You have the right to an attorney.

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.130
If you know anyone—

00:15:13.130 --> 00:15:14.430
Punch!

00:15:14.680 --> 00:15:16.270
All right, attack confirmed.

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:17.380
Level 4.

00:15:17.380 --> 00:15:20.020
According to Provision 12 
of the Secret Service Act,

00:15:20.020 --> 00:15:22.020
you're now allowed to use material force.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.020
Roger that.

00:15:23.020 --> 00:15:25.190
In accordance with the law, 
I will now exercise material force.

00:15:32.470 --> 00:15:33.990
What's that?

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:34.830
Bastard!

00:15:34.830 --> 00:15:36.080
He fell for it.

00:15:40.030 --> 00:15:40.780
There!

00:15:40.780 --> 00:15:41.500
Take that!

00:15:41.500 --> 00:15:44.040
Damn you... You think you can get away?

00:15:44.430 --> 00:15:46.460
I can still get you, even if you're behind me.

00:15:46.840 --> 00:15:47.800
What?

00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:49.170
It's no good, Section Chief.

00:15:49.470 --> 00:15:50.830
I can't fire from here.

00:15:50.830 --> 00:15:51.800
Send me the data.

00:15:52.900 --> 00:15:55.230
God, so many rubberneckers!

00:15:55.230 --> 00:15:57.640
Guess that's why they were live streaming.

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:01.280
If I may, I propose that the perps 
are heading for Chofu Airport.

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:02.600
We should get there first.

00:16:03.110 --> 00:16:04.710
What is Oscar II's charge status?

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.170
It's at forty-three percent.

00:16:06.170 --> 00:16:07.740
All right, I'll get going.

00:16:07.740 --> 00:16:09.360
Are you even listening to me?

00:16:09.360 --> 00:16:12.350
You're referring to how one of their 
posts had a station number, right?

00:16:12.350 --> 00:16:13.240
For Takaido Station or whatever.

00:16:13.240 --> 00:16:13.990
Huh?

00:16:14.210 --> 00:16:16.740
Oscar I, report the perps' current location.

00:16:17.240 --> 00:16:19.800
Command, this is Oscar I.

00:16:19.800 --> 00:16:21.960
The perps are headed toward Ikebukuro.

00:16:22.220 --> 00:16:23.150
See?

00:16:23.150 --> 00:16:26.260
Their mention of Takaido was a trap.

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:29.140
Let's flank them around Edogawabashi.

00:16:29.140 --> 00:16:29.840
Roger.

00:16:30.690 --> 00:16:32.960
Vitals, all green.

00:16:32.960 --> 00:16:34.030
All green.

00:16:34.030 --> 00:16:35.840
All green, lock.

00:16:42.770 --> 00:16:45.270
Inner unit, begin output.

00:16:48.780 --> 00:16:52.240
Oscar II, set strike interceptor unit.

00:17:05.710 --> 00:17:06.550
Hmm?

00:17:06.550 --> 00:17:09.590
How did he know it was a trap?

00:17:09.590 --> 00:17:11.700
If they really wanted an audience,

00:17:11.700 --> 00:17:13.340
they'd be more straightforward.

00:17:14.000 --> 00:17:16.770
Kazari-san, you're thinking too hard.

00:17:16.770 --> 00:17:19.340
Relax a bit, okay?

00:17:22.270 --> 00:17:23.150
Let's go!

00:17:23.150 --> 00:17:24.630
Combine!

00:17:24.630 --> 00:17:26.120
Yahoo!

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:28.610
The perps are gaining speed! 
Request permission to fire!

00:17:28.610 --> 00:17:32.880
Sorry, there's a building of significance to 
the former prime minister nearby, so...

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:33.800
Huh?

00:17:33.800 --> 00:17:34.780
Something wrong?

00:17:35.060 --> 00:17:36.200
Can you see?

00:17:36.200 --> 00:17:38.280
From the direction opposite Oscar II, there's...

00:17:39.430 --> 00:17:40.980
Whoops.

00:17:41.410 --> 00:17:43.440
Cut it out, you two.

00:17:43.440 --> 00:17:44.590
This is the police.

00:17:45.070 --> 00:17:46.250
Further resistance—

00:17:47.080 --> 00:17:48.460
Whoops!

00:17:48.460 --> 00:17:48.880
What?

00:17:48.880 --> 00:17:50.340
Bye-bye!

00:17:49.620 --> 00:17:50.340
A Störche?

00:17:50.340 --> 00:17:51.270
Huh?

00:17:51.270 --> 00:17:52.340
That's going way too far!

00:17:52.340 --> 00:17:54.590
They're making a run for Gyoen.

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:58.410
What's with them?

00:17:58.410 --> 00:18:01.600
After I went to the trouble to get here, 
they're just going back to Shinjuku?

00:18:02.270 --> 00:18:03.600
I won't let you get away!

00:18:03.600 --> 00:18:04.390
Come with me!

00:18:04.390 --> 00:18:06.310
Whoa! Wh-What the...

00:18:06.530 --> 00:18:08.430
Oscar II, stop!

00:18:08.430 --> 00:18:09.980
I've told you before not do this.

00:18:09.980 --> 00:18:12.730
That's why I've been trying my best not to!

00:18:12.730 --> 00:18:14.510
I don't need bureaucratic talk from you!

00:18:14.510 --> 00:18:15.440
Just...

00:18:15.790 --> 00:18:17.740
What's with those two?

00:18:17.740 --> 00:18:21.320
Kyoukai-san, what's Oscar I's strength, 
and do we have emergency missiles?

00:18:21.320 --> 00:18:23.000
It should be fine.

00:18:23.000 --> 00:18:23.740
Huh?

00:18:23.740 --> 00:18:27.240
Command, request confirmation 
of target-capture site.

00:18:24.450 --> 00:18:25.530
Hey...

00:18:25.980 --> 00:18:28.600
Stop! Stop!

00:18:27.240 --> 00:18:27.970
Roger.

00:18:27.970 --> 00:18:29.730
Searching for potential capture sites.

00:18:31.210 --> 00:18:32.030
Huh?

00:18:32.030 --> 00:18:32.800
What's wrong?

00:18:33.880 --> 00:18:37.380
Confirmed hit. Sending address now.

00:18:37.640 --> 00:18:40.300
It's a building scheduled for demolition.

00:18:40.300 --> 00:18:42.260
Keep it contained within the property.

00:18:42.510 --> 00:18:43.690
I'll do my best.

00:18:45.800 --> 00:18:49.020
If I'd known I'd be in such a repulsive operation...

00:18:49.020 --> 00:18:50.510
Do you need medical attention?

00:18:50.510 --> 00:18:51.770
For your wounded heart?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.580
The thought is more than enough.

00:18:54.240 --> 00:18:56.040
Cancel the operation immediately!

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:57.900
It's too disorganized and dangerous!

00:18:57.900 --> 00:19:01.170
We still have Code of Criminal Investigations, 
Article 21, so don't worry.

00:19:01.170 --> 00:19:02.700
I can't accept this.

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:06.670
I'll report to HQ where justice truly lies—

00:19:06.670 --> 00:19:07.910
There's no such thing.

00:19:07.910 --> 00:19:08.840
Huh?

00:19:08.840 --> 00:19:10.710
This is a job.

00:19:10.710 --> 00:19:11.540
What?

00:19:11.540 --> 00:19:13.580
More importantly, Kazari-san,

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:16.100
can you head to the capture site?

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:18.720
Oh, I was just thinking that myself.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:19.670
Agreed.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:22.170
Only one of us here can take action, anyway.

00:19:22.170 --> 00:19:22.980
Huh?

00:19:26.100 --> 00:19:27.850
You guys, follow!

00:19:35.300 --> 00:19:37.400
<i>What's with this insane plan?</i>

00:19:37.400 --> 00:19:39.740
<i>I'll just have to take charge, after all.</i>

00:19:41.600 --> 00:19:43.630
Sorry for repeating, but we're the police.

00:19:43.630 --> 00:19:45.840
You are under arrest for armed 
robbery, property damage,

00:19:45.840 --> 00:19:47.360
obstruction of justice, and...

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:48.040
Crap!

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:50.410
We were so close to getting away!

00:19:50.410 --> 00:19:51.740
Toward the bay?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:52.330
Huh?

00:19:53.140 --> 00:19:56.840
We already figured that out when 
you guys tried to lure us to Chofu.

00:19:57.330 --> 00:20:02.050
By now, the quicksand areas in Ryogoku 
and Nihonbashi are all cordoned off.

00:20:02.050 --> 00:20:03.430
Screw this!

00:20:03.430 --> 00:20:05.480
We have the power output of two units.

00:20:05.480 --> 00:20:06.680
Melt, bastard!

00:20:09.840 --> 00:20:11.300
Oh, is this it?

00:20:12.560 --> 00:20:13.850
That won't work.

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:17.370
We've already coated our units, 
after figuring out your specs.

00:20:18.570 --> 00:20:20.280
Damn it, bastard!

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:23.280
Oh? Why don't you power down your Willwears?

00:20:23.280 --> 00:20:25.610
Hey, they're minors.

00:20:25.610 --> 00:20:27.700
So what?

00:20:29.810 --> 00:20:31.040
I don't give a crap anymore!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:32.670
I'm gonna melt you!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.720
It's all your fault!

00:20:35.780 --> 00:20:37.670
W-We're minors!

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:40.370
I've determined that you can't be reasoned with.

00:20:43.610 --> 00:20:45.860
Oh, I'm out of power.

00:20:46.310 --> 00:20:49.430
It's because you fooled around 
and made me waste power!

00:20:49.430 --> 00:20:51.830
What? You're blaming me?

00:20:52.640 --> 00:20:53.500
Boss!

00:20:53.500 --> 00:20:55.650
Can we start Phase 7 yet?

00:20:55.650 --> 00:20:57.110
Still getting a final confirmation.

00:20:57.370 --> 00:21:01.050
I see... Shinjuku Ward can't authorize it?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:03.330
That's unfortunate.

00:21:03.330 --> 00:21:05.870
Tell the ward mayor that, at this rate,

00:21:05.870 --> 00:21:07.770
the secret club, Sappo—

00:21:07.770 --> 00:21:09.050
H-Hey!

00:21:09.050 --> 00:21:11.420
Fine, do whatever you want!

00:21:11.720 --> 00:21:12.870
We have permission.

00:21:12.870 --> 00:21:14.620
Just one more.

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:15.750
Seriously, screw this!

00:21:14.620 --> 00:21:19.230
<b>Approved

00:21:15.750 --> 00:21:18.130
I'll use all the power we've got left!

00:21:19.230 --> 00:21:20.000
<b>Approved

00:21:20.000 --> 00:21:21.470
You know...

00:21:21.470 --> 00:21:24.760
You should really try to expand your vocabulary!

00:21:24.760 --> 00:21:26.170
There's no time left.

00:21:26.170 --> 00:21:28.180
Want me to unlock the sublimation module?

00:21:28.180 --> 00:21:29.280
Permission granted.

00:21:29.480 --> 00:21:30.420
Permission granted.

00:21:30.420 --> 00:21:31.390
Permission confirmed.

00:21:32.810 --> 00:21:33.730
<b>Sublimation Module</b>

00:21:33.730 --> 00:21:35.200
This ends here.

00:21:39.970 --> 00:21:41.830
Bye, minors.

00:21:42.630 --> 00:21:45.790
Destructive Ram Cannon, fire!

00:21:57.810 --> 00:21:59.880
Yeah!

00:22:00.690 --> 00:22:01.960
Did I get here in time?

00:22:02.280 --> 00:22:03.580
Out of power.

00:22:03.880 --> 00:22:06.770
Commencing emergency purge for pilot safety.

00:22:07.090 --> 00:22:08.540
Out of power.

00:22:07.820 --> 00:22:08.540
No!

00:22:08.540 --> 00:22:09.760
Commencing emergency purge...

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:13.480
This is an experimental division.

00:22:13.480 --> 00:22:15.720
We must avoid having our faces seen at any cost.

00:22:15.720 --> 00:22:16.520
So...

00:22:25.320 --> 00:22:29.330
No!

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:33.540
Care to try the welcome party course 
menu from the renovated Abumiya?

00:22:29.820 --> 00:22:33.830
<b>Japanese Izakaya</b>

00:22:33.830 --> 00:22:36.870
You'll find the perfect place here!

00:22:38.350 --> 00:22:40.380
She's still a minor.

00:22:40.380 --> 00:22:42.590
We haven't let her drink.

00:22:42.590 --> 00:22:44.310
Then why's she like this?

00:22:44.310 --> 00:22:46.880
I think she's been in shock the whole day.

00:22:47.120 --> 00:22:48.480
It's the real world.

00:22:48.480 --> 00:22:51.100
It's because you get too 
hung up over the details.

00:22:51.320 --> 00:22:53.850
It isn't exactly good to ignore details, either.

00:22:53.850 --> 00:22:54.760
Oh?

00:22:54.760 --> 00:22:56.980
Don't take it so seriously.

00:22:57.670 --> 00:22:59.980
By the way, about the perps' posts...

00:23:00.240 --> 00:23:01.810
They were by someone else.

00:23:01.810 --> 00:23:03.120
What should we do?

00:23:03.120 --> 00:23:05.930
We don't have any jurisdiction to investigate.

00:23:05.930 --> 00:23:09.610
The Störche was taken into Saitama 
Prefectural Police custody, too.

00:23:09.610 --> 00:23:11.930
Then we have no cards to play.

00:23:11.930 --> 00:23:14.990
How does the brass feel about Unit 8, anyway?

00:23:15.280 --> 00:23:17.950
Naturally, they're concerned.

00:23:17.950 --> 00:23:22.160
They even assigned a special 
person like Kazari-san to us.

00:23:22.160 --> 00:23:24.000
Oh, I'm not special at all.

00:23:26.210 --> 00:23:28.210
<i>High expectations have been placed on me.</i>

00:23:28.560 --> 00:23:30.980
<i>The continued existence of</i>

00:23:30.980 --> 00:23:33.330
<i>this division depends upon my report—</i>

00:23:32.640 --> 00:23:34.530
Oh, about your report.

00:23:34.530 --> 00:23:35.220
Huh?

00:23:35.220 --> 00:23:38.470
Make sure you include the fact that you 
got your notepad snatched in your report.

00:23:38.470 --> 00:23:39.180
Huh?

00:23:39.180 --> 00:23:40.440
Well, of course she should.

00:23:41.230 --> 00:23:42.270
Yeah.

00:23:43.480 --> 00:23:45.400
<i>They're right...</i>

00:23:46.090 --> 00:23:48.550
<i>But it still stings!</i>

00:23:50.030 --> 00:23:52.360
<b>Next Episode Preview</b>

00:23:51.310 --> 00:23:52.770
Ohakonyapachininko!

00:23:52.360 --> 00:24:04.910
File 2: Academy Destruction

00:23:52.770 --> 00:23:54.450
Welcome to Liko's active 
predictions for the future!

00:23:54.450 --> 00:23:56.740
This is where I predict what 
will happen next episode.

00:23:56.740 --> 00:23:59.120
Whoa! Boss's rack is growing!

00:23:59.120 --> 00:24:00.900
Could it be love?

00:24:00.900 --> 00:24:03.470
But the subtitle says "Academy Destruction."

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:04.350
What a mystery!
